# Un'Goro Crater (53-54): the Horde visit of Un'Goro Crater, with the Thunder Bluff and Ratchet
# quests tied to it, for a Horde duo.
#
# Built into the addon with:
#   python3 addon/tools/guide_build.py addon/guides/ungoro_crater_53_54.guide --db data/forever.sqlite
#
# Research (November 2026): givers, objectives, prerequisites and the places of mobs and objects
# from the game data (data/forever.sqlite), checked against outof.games (Un'Goro Crater, area 490).
# The guide's quest list is section 19 of addon/guides/horde_40_60_allocation.md. Crystals of Power
# (4284, the pylons' prerequisite), The Scent of Lar'korwi (4291) and the Marshal's Refuge flight
# path come from Feralas & Un'Goro Crater (49-50).
# Carried in: Delivery to Magatha (3518, from Jediga in Azshara), March of the Silithid (4494, from
# Zilzibin Drumlore in Orgrimmar), The Strength of Corruption (4120,
# taken at Camp Mojache, its bears and wolves killed in Felwood) and Seeking Spiritual Aid (5158,
# from Greta Mosshoof in Felwood).
# Left to later guides: Magatha's Payment to Jediga (3562, Azshara), Cleansed Water Returns to
# Felwood (5159), The New Springs (980, Winterspring) and Rabine Saturna (1123, Moonglade).
# Pawn Captures Queen (4507, after Bungle in the Jungle) is taken at the hand-in of Bungle in the
# Jungle in Gadgetzan, after the hearthstone: an optional second trip into the Gorishi hive for its
# queen (three waves of Gorishi, then the queen) and the ride back. Calm Before the Storm
# (4509, then 4511) follows it to Zilzibin Drumlore and Karus in Orgrimmar, the last stop.
# Optional, for a group: the Kor'kron of Alcaz Prison, a dungeon on Alcaz Island off Dustwallow Marsh.
# The Missing Kor'kron (95283, Eitrigg in Orgrimmar), The Elite of the Elite (95284, Nazeer Bloodpike
# in Brackenwall) and Right Place, Wrong Time (95285, Sergeant Ulka) lead to the prison, between
# Ratchet and Gadgetzan. Inside: No Orc Left Behind (95309, finding Commander Folkar: outof.games
# lists no turn-in, and it is handed in to Folkar, not to Ulka as the data says), The Honor of the
# Kor'kron (95454, Blazeroar, then the Perfumed Note), Bad News for Folkar (96369, from the note),
# The Man in the Iron Chains (96335, Mason Connery and The Questioner's key), A Little Payback (96332,
# the Strashaz naga and Tidemistress Ca'zass, handed in to Ulka) and Blood Red Bandanas (96334, the
# human guards). Thrall Needs to Know (95483, Folkar to Thrall) and Blood Red Bandanas are handed in
# in Orgrimmar at the end. The data has no giver for 95454, 95483, 96335 and 96369 nor a place for
# the NPCs inside: the steps name them ("npc") and point at the prison's door by Ulka.
# Left out: Zapper Fuel (4146) and Bloodpetal Zapper (4148): the Atal'ai Haze drops only inside the
# Temple of Atal'Hakkar dungeon. It's Dangerous to Go Alone (3962): it needs Linken's Adventure
# (3961), the end of Linken's chain done in Winterspring (58-59). Hol'anyee's Big Book of Big Lizards
# (92020): level 55 to take, handed in at the summit of Mount Hyjal, where no guide goes.
#
# The route: Orgrimmar (the auction house); Ratchet; Gadgetzan; down the
# slope into Un'Goro to Torwa Pathfinder, then north along the east side (Lar'korwi, the gorillas) to
# Marshal's Refuge; one big loop (the north and east, Torwa again, the hive, Terror Run, the west,
# Fire Plume Ridge and Ringo back to the refuge); U'cha and A-Me 01 in the gorilla cave; Torwa a last
# time and the hearthstone to Gadgetzan; Camp Mojache, Thunder Bluff, Ratchet and Orgrimmar.

guide Un'Goro Crater (53-54)
faction horde
levels 53 54
carry 3518 3563 3568 3909 4120 4494 5084 5158
leave 980 1123 3562 3563 3568 3909 5084 5159
next Azshara (54-54)

# Orgrimmar -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

map Orgrimmar
ah 4244.1 npc 8673
tip A-Me 01, a robot in Un'Goro Crater, needs a Mithril Casing. Nothing in the crater drops it: buy it here, or have an engineer make it.
ah 4496.2 npc 8673
ah 3761.1 npc 8673
tip Un'Goro Soil: 5 for Alchemist Pestlezugg and 20 for Thunder Bluff, so 25 in all. It also comes from the dirt piles all over the crater.
accept 95283
tip Optional, for Alcaz Prison, a dungeon off Dustwallow Marsh: Eitrigg, in Grommash Hold, has lost a Kor'kron squad there. The guide goes on the way, between Ratchet and Gadgetzan. Not going? Right-click this step: the whole chain goes with it.
fly "Ratchet, The Barrens" npc 3310

# Ratchet -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

map The Barrens
accept 4502
turnin 5158
accept 5159
tip Cleansed Water Returns to Felwood is handed in by a later guide.

# Alcaz Island and Alcaz Prison (optional, a dungeon) ------------------------------------------------

note "Optional, for Alcaz Prison: take the flight from Ratchet to Brackenwall Village, Dustwallow Marsh" npc 16227
tip Not doing Alcaz Prison? Click this step and the note after the prison to pass them; the quests between pass themselves.
map Dustwallow Marsh
turnin 95283
tip Nazeer Bloodpike stands in Brackenwall Village.
accept 95284
turnin 95284
tip Sergeant Ulka waits on Alcaz Island, off the north-east coast of the marsh: ride east along the north shore and swim across.
accept 95285
do 95285 icon talk "Talk to Sergeant Ulka"
turnin 95285
accept 95309 96332 96334
tip Alcaz Prison is a dungeon for five players (its quests are level 53), its door on the island by Ulka. The three tasks are all done inside.
do 96334 bg at 70.3,18.9
tip The Defias Bounty Hunters, Alcaz Jailers, Chaplains and the other human guards drop Blood Red Bandanas, all through the prison.
turnin 95309 npc 260386 at 70.3,18.9
tip Inside, take the first right, down the stairs, then keep left to Commander Folkar. Leave The Questioner, on the way, for later: his key is for another task.
accept 95454 npc 260386 at 70.3,18.9
do 95454 at 70.3,18.9
tip Go left again to Zarla Ober: at 30% health she turns into Blazeroar. Kill it.
accept 96335 npc 264770 at 70.3,18.9
tip Mason Connery, near where Blazeroar fell, asks for the key to his shackles.
turnin 95454 at 70.3,18.9 "Read the Perfumed Note on the floor in the middle of the room"
accept 96369 at 70.3,18.9 "Pick up the Perfumed Note again: it starts Bad News for Folkar"
turnin 96369 npc 260386 at 70.3,18.9
tip Back to Commander Folkar in the room before.
accept 95483 npc 260386 at 70.3,18.9
tip Folkar's report goes to Thrall in Orgrimmar, at the end of this guide.
do 96335 mobs 256236 at 70.3,18.9
tip Go back toward the entrance and kill The Questioner, whom you passed on the way in, for the Ornate Shackle Key.
turnin 96335 npc 264770 at 70.3,18.9
tip Back to Mason Connery.
do 96332.1 mobs 255995 at 70.3,18.9 "Kill 15 Strashaz Soldiers"
tip From the entrance, the middle hallway leads to the Strashaz naga.
do 96332.2 mobs 255373 at 70.3,18.9 "Kill 8 Strashaz Enchantresses"
do 96332.3 at 70.3,18.9
tip Tidemistress Ca'zass holds the end of the naga's hall. Short of kills afterwards? Your group can reset the dungeon.
do 96334 at 70.3,18.9
tip Short of bandanas? Any of the human guards still drops them.
turnin 96332
tip Sergeant Ulka is outside the door. Blood Red Bandanas goes to Eitrigg, Thrall Needs to Know to Thrall: both in Orgrimmar, at the end of this guide.
note "Swim back to the shore, ride west to Brackenwall Village and take the flight to Gadgetzan" npc 11899
tip Click this step once you are on your way: taking off passes the flight step after it.
map The Barrens
fly "Gadgetzan, Tanaris" npc 16227
tip Skipped Alcaz Prison? Fly from Ratchet to Gadgetzan.

