# Un'Goro Crater: Torwa Pathfinder, then north along the east side ---------------------------------

map Un'Goro Crater
accept 4289 4292 87492
tip Ride south-west out of Gadgetzan and down the slope into the crater: Torwa camps at its foot.
do 4496.2 bg icon pickup at 44.5,53.5
tip Un'Goro Dirt Piles lie all over the crater, and the oozes and tar beasts drop soil too. Gather 25: 20 of them are for Thunder Bluff.
do 87492
tip The damaged crystal lies just west of Torwa's camp.
turnin 87492
do 4292
tip Open Torwa's Pouch. Follow the trail up into the eastern hills to the clearing strewn with huge bones: put the meat down there, then use the pheromone mixture on it to call Lar'korwi, a level 56 raptor.
do 4289
tip The gorillas, stompers and thunderers live in and around the cave in the north-east. Gorillas call for help from far away, and the Thunderers have a hard-hitting instant shock: pull carefully.

