# The north: the Northern Pylon and the Pterrordax --------------------------------------------------

do 4503.2 bg
do 4503.1 bg
tip Every pterrordax and diemetradon of the crater can drop the scales, about one kill in four and for only one of you at a time, so expect plenty of kills. Pterrordax gather on the hills of the south (around 44,89 and 55,88) and near the crystal pylons.
do 4501.1 bg
do 4285
tip The Northern Crystal Pylon stands on the hill east of the refuge.

