# The gorilla cave: U'cha and A-Me 01 -------------------------------------------------------------

do 4301
tip U'cha, a red level 55 gorilla, waits at the very back of the gorilla cave (around 68,12). Clear the Thunderers and Stompers on the way before the plain gorillas, which call for help when hurt; they respawn quickly, so don't linger.
turnin 4243
tip A-Me 01 sits inside the cave: keep to the right-hand wall as you go in.
